Deploy somewhere.

Usage: ok cli_choices_help.ok <env> [--role <admin|user>] [--region <eu|us>] [--tag <a|b>]

Arguments:
  <env>                where to deploy [choices: staging, production]

Options:
  --role <admin|user>  who deploys [default: user]
  --region <eu|us>     an optional region
  --tag <a|b>          tags from a fixed set (repeatable)
  -h, --help           print this help
